va tomāra"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":108,"first_line":"ki jāni ki bale","author":"Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"},"title":["Goptṛtve Varaṇa"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["ki jāni ki bale    tomāra dhāmete","    ha-inu śaraṇāgata","tumi dayāmaya    patita-pāvana","    patita-tāraṇe rata"],"translation":["I do not know by what force I have taken shelter within Your abode. Surely it is by Your mercy alone, for You are ever seeking the purification and deliverance of the fallen souls."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["bharasā āmāra    ei mātra nātha!","    tumi ta’ karuṇā-maya","tava dayā pātra    nāhi mora sama","    avaśya ghuchāre bhaya"],"translation":["O Lord! You are merciful. This is my sole hope. There is no one who needs Your mercy more than I. Certainly You will dispel all my fear."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["āmāre tārite    kāhāra śakati","    avanī-bhitare nāhi","dayāla ṭhākura!    ghoṣaṇā tomāra","    adhama pāmare trāhi"],"translation":["There is no one on earth who has the power to deliver me. O merciful Lord! It is Your declaration that You deliver the lowest, most sinful persons."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["sakala chhāḍiyā    āsiyāchhi āmi","    tomāra charaṇe nātha!","āmi nitya-dāsa    tumi pālayitā","    tumi goptā, jagannātha!"],"translation":["Abandoning everything, I have come to Your feet, O Lord! I am Your eternal servant, and You are my maintainer and protector, O Lord of the universe!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["tomāra sakala    āmi mātra dāsa","    āmāra tāribe tumi","tomāra charaṇa    karinu varaṇa","    āmāra nahi ta’ āmi"],"translation":["Everything is Yours. I am only a servant. Certainly You will deliver me. I have embraced Your feet and no longer belong to myself."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["bhakati-vinoda    kā̐diya śaraṇa","    la’yechhe tomāra pāya","kṣami’ aparādha    nāme ruchi diyā","    pālana karahe tāya"],"translation":["Weeping, Bhakti Vinod takes shelter at Your feet. Forgiving his offences and giving him a taste for the Name, kindly maintain him."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-goptritve","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/17-ki-jani-ki-bale","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/ki-jani-ki-bole","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Sudarshan Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/sudarshan-prabhu-goptrtve","personSlug":"sudarshan-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Goptṛtve-Varaṇa-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/ki-jani-ki-bale-tomara-dhamete/","description":"Goptṛtve Varaṇa — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Goptṛtve Varaṇa. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-pe","slug":"ki-jani-ki-bale-tomara-dhamete"}}